# Phase 11 (docs/phase11-brief.md 3.7, 7 criterion 9; Rev 1 L-7): a
# shutdown with the battery low draws "Connect to Power" on the UI thread
# (clean_shutdown -> ui_sys_low_battery) for 2 s, also when it starts with
# the backlight off (the screen wakes first). Hold PLAY off the charger
# starts the same shutdown path as the battery monitor's.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p11-sys-lowbatt.script
# needs: library
# log: sys lowbatt empty=0 drawn=1
# nolog: splash-pass

wait 4000
battery 5
charger off
backlight_expire     # dark first: the screen must wake to draw
wait 3000
hold PLAY 1500       # sys_poweroff() -> clean_shutdown(): battery low
wait 600
shot connect_to_power
wait 3000
